WEBVTT

00:04:29.121 --> 00:04:30.621
prayog karanee chaahie

00:04:30.621 --> 00:04:32.871
Aapko unakee pahachaan
ke baare mein savel

00:04:32.871 --> 00:04:34.621
poochhane ke laalach
ho skata hai

00:04:34.621 --> 00:04:36.579
Ise pahale ki aap poochhen,

00:04:36.579 --> 00:04:37.663
aapane aap se poochho

00:04:37.663 --> 00:04:39.788
Kya mujhe internet par javab mil skata jai

00:04:39.788 --> 00:04:42.121
Haan shaayad

00:04:42.121 --> 00:04:43.454
Yadi nahee,

00:04:43.454 --> 00:04:45.788
Apane aap se poochhen
ki kya yah poochhana

00:04:45.788 --> 00:04:46.996
vkaktigat hai?

00:04:46.996 --> 00:04:48.663
Aap poochh sakate hain,

00:04:48.663 --> 00:04:51.746
Kya aise juchh hai jo main kar 
sakoon madade ke lie?

00:04:51.746 --> 00:04:55.163
Yeh hai yadi aap vyakti
men javaab de rahe hain

00:04:55.163 --> 00:04:57.496
Lekin, agar aap ek
sakriy dost banne hain

00:04:57.496 --> 00:04:59.246
to sahamati sampaat nahin
hotee hain

00:04:59.246 --> 00:05:02.371
Yah sahayogiyon aur maanav
sansaadhanon ke paas jahate hain